u00e3o 2026?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">A 7\u00aa edi\u00e7\u00e3o realiza-se no s\u00e1bado, 17 de outubro de 2026, com partida \u00e0s 10h00 no Est\u00e1dio do Drag\u00e3o \/ Alameda das Antas, no Porto.<\/div><\/details><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quais s\u00e3o as dist\u00e2ncias dispon\u00edveis no evento?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O programa integra a Corrida do Drag\u00e3o de 10 km (cronometrada) e a Caminhada do Drag\u00e3o de 5 km para todas as idades.<\/div><\/details><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">\u00c9 obrigat\u00f3rio correr com a camisola oficial do evento?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">Sim, o regulamento estipula como obrigat\u00f3rio o uso da T-shirt oficial da Corrida do Drag\u00e3o 2026 durante a participa\u00e7\u00e3o na prova.<\/div><\/details><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">O que inclui o kit de participante?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">A inscri\u00e7\u00e3o confere direito \u00e0 t-shirt t\u00e9cnica oficial, dorsal personalizado com chip (10km), seguro desportivo, abastecimentos e medalha de finalista.<\/div><\/details><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Onde posso garantir a minha inscri\u00e7\u00e3o oficial?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">As inscri\u00e7\u00f5es oficiais realizam-se online no portal oficial da Corrida do Drag\u00e3o atrav\u00e9s da liga\u00e7\u00e3o dispon\u00edvel no Portugal Running.<\/div><\/details><\/div><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"SportsEvent\", \"name\": \"7\u00aa Corrida do Drag\u00e3o 2026\", \"startDate\": \"2026-10-17\", \"eventAttendanceMode\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/OfflineEventAttendanceMode\", \"eventStatus\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/EventScheduled\", \"location\": {\"@type\": \"Place\", \"name\": \"Est\u00e1dio do Drag\u00e3o, Porto\", \"address\": {\"@type\": \"PostalAddress\", \"addressLocality\": \"Porto\", \"addressRegion\": \"Porto\", \"addressCountry\": \"PT\"}}, \"organizer\": {\"@type\": \"Organization\", \"name\": \"Futebol Clube do Porto\"}}<\/script><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"FAQPage\", \"mainEntity\": [{\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Qual \u00e9 a data e o local de partida da Corrida do Drag\u00e3o 2026?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"A 7\u00aa edi\u00e7\u00e3o realiza-se no s\u00e1bado, 17 de outubro de 2026, com partida \u00e0s 10h00 no Est\u00e1dio do Drag\u00e3o \/ Alameda das Antas, no Porto.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Quais s\u00e3o as dist\u00e2ncias dispon\u00edveis no evento?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"O programa integra a Corrida do Drag\u00e3o de 10 km (cronometrada) e a Caminhada do Drag\u00e3o de 5 km para todas as idades.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"\u00c9 obrigat\u00f3rio correr com a camisola oficial do evento?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Sim, o regulamento estipula como obrigat\u00f3rio o uso da T-shirt oficial da Corrida do Drag\u00e3o 2026 durante a participa\u00e7\u00e3o na prova.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"O que inclui o kit de participante?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"A inscri\u00e7\u00e3o confere direito \u00e0 t-shirt t\u00e9cnica oficial, dorsal personalizado com chip (10km), seguro desportivo, abastecimentos e medalha de finalista.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Onde posso garantir a minha inscri\u00e7\u00e3o oficial?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"As inscri\u00e7\u00f5es oficiais realizam-se online no portal oficial da Corrida do Drag\u00e3o atrav\u00e9s da liga\u00e7\u00e3o dispon\u00edvel no Portugal Running.\"}}]}<\/script>","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":68915,"menu_order":0,"comment_status":"closed","ping_status":"closed","template":"","meta":{"_acf_changed":false},"tags":[],"event_type":[28,672,27],"event_type_2":[24,726,820],"event_type_3":[],"event_type_4":[],"event_type_5":[],"class_list":["post-50329","ajde_events","type-ajde_events","status-publish","has-post-thumbnail","hentry","event_location-porto","event_type-corrida-10-km","event_type-caminhada","event_type-corrida","event_type_2-porto","event_type_2-porto-e-norte","event_type_2-portugal"],"acf":[],"featured_image_src":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/09\/cartaz-corrida-do-dragao-2.webp","ams_acf":[],"_links":{"self":